# Acceptance Criteria

Universal requirement for acceptance criteria in user stories.

## When to Apply

Apply this rule when:
- Writing user stories
- Creating feature specifications
- Defining requirements
- Documenting user needs

## Lambda Engine Mode

**Mode 1 (Duality Navigation)** - Stable requirement patterns.

